<title>GERMANY: Schering says 96 Betaferon sales 535 mln DM.</title>
<headline>Schering says 96 Betaferon sales 535 mln DM.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>German drugs group Schering AG said on Thursday 1996 global sales of its multiple sclerosis drug Betaferon reached its target of 535 million marks.</p>
<p>The company, which faced competing multiple sclerosis drugs in the United States and had a difficult Betaferon launch in Europe, also said it expected sales of the drug to rise to 590 million marks in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49 228 260 97 150</p>
